  "html": "<p>感謝所有參加&nbsp;EMRD 學程與校友會合辦之新生說明座談會的新生、校友以及師長們，在學長姐和師長的熱心協助下，113 級新生的校園生活和課程學習一定會更豐富順利，希望這次的座談會，可以幫助新生們對未來的學習有更清晰的規劃，感受到我們的歡迎和關心，期待新學期的到來！</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/0858aa8dc7-607095117.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/1e3d706b8d-172674346.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/07cd691552-543688562.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/54ad28a847-877613244.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/cdd9c27485-810818951.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/6cbf16a845-812676103.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/2ce056f548-160382208.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/b3ebcc850b-242869198.jpg\" width=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/6fda8a5c69-893607928.jpg\" width=\"450\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/3996d03f8f-915266999.jpg\" width=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/3ecc6732c4-607050934.jpg\" width=\"450\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/95e3f7b455-820027976.jpg\" width=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/63c0981c63-462550475.jpg\" width=\"450\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/35165b2d67-213534223.jpg\" width=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/d3e196b981-225790763.jpg\" width=\"450\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/45f8c0a6a6-399494011.jpg\" width=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/613432f24a-310152964.jpg\" width=\"450\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/1d95739a85-903234855.jpg\" width=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/i